{"3758170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Robot Rhapsody", "steam_appid": 3758170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/fff3881adaa3a86d01765228b67ba37b.avif?t=1784152423\" width=761 height=476 /></span><strong></strong><br> <strong>Robot Rhapsody is a 'new-retro' cinematic RPG set in a future world on the edges of machine singularity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❤️‍🔥 Challenging turn-based combat, inspired by classic RPGs.<br>⚙️ HACK robot enemies to join the party. UPGRADE them all with distinct items and parts.<br>💥 Story Themes touching AI, futurism, cultism, dystopias, and transcendence.<br><strong>🗺️ Open-ended exploration.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/fb0fdcf13b6a01c5885adaf1762df8e0.avif?t=1784152423\" width=761 height=476 /></span><br> <br><strong>💥 Follow Selva, a cynical luddite mercenary. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formerly trained to hunt “rogue” robots, she now lives off-grid in exile.  <br>Yet new events drag her back to the technocratic future she can’t escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚙️ Her ally is Jiro, a boy raised entirely within the <u>Aethar Hives</u></strong>; <br>Underground bomb shelters that have been transformed into AI-controlled “utopias.” </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jiro's every move is micromanaged by “godlike” AGI, robots, photo-real VR, and negative-emotion-suppressing systems</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Despite their opposite nature, the two are ultimately drawn together. <br>A reluctant friendship that sparks widespread rebellion.</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/bab18db91e33418364cb47f13d511f4c.avif?t=1784152423\" width=761 height=476 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💥 </strong>Explore a war-scorched former metropolis; <u>Zoxxo City</u>. </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various new neighborhoods, shortcuts, quests, &amp; secrets appear incrementally as the story unfolds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful street vendors, machine smugglers, stem-cell harvesters, cultish luddites, and a deranged robotic carnival troupe are among dozens of NPCs you'll encounter. Inspired by Majora's Mask, they each have their own evolving schedules.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/bf395802040eb1683109f2bae5ba9aec.avif?t=1784152423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras_big/bf395802040eb1683109f2bae5ba9aec.webp?t=1784152423 width=1560 height=1601 /></span><u>Navigate the BOUNTY system</u>: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players will be hunted by malevolent robots</strong>, <u>to a greater or lesser extent</u>, stemming from player choices!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain the chance to Inflict</strong> <strong>machine-specific status effects,</strong> such as <strong><u>SHORT-CIRCUIT</u> (electric stun)</strong>, and <strong><u>VIRUS</u> (confused/berserk behavior), </strong>to disadvantage the robot foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain characters can use <strong><u>HACK</u></strong>, forcing some robotic enemies to fight alongside the party—or even upgrade them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike human allies; once robot allies reach K/O status, they're gone forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d9ae6630b30c97f22ab1d819fcc733fd.poster.avif?t=1784152423\" width=594 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d9ae6630b30c97f22ab1d819fcc733fd.webm?t=1784152423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d9ae6630b30c97f22ab1d819fcc733fd.mp4?t=1784152423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/ff63b55b71b324baf043ecbe46340675.avif?t=1784152423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras_big/ff63b55b71b324baf043ecbe46340675.avif?t=1784152423 width=800 height=566 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unlike Beloved Rapture, our previous title</i> - <strong><u>in Robot Rhapsody, most of the game's world will be completely open from the very start of the game</u></strong>, encouraging greater replay value, and player-defined consequences. The sprawling world offers freedom for the player to chart their own path - yet the &quot;main story&quot; remains cinematic/linear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d63457f03bb4b24dcd0197fbbd9ee6be.avif?t=1784152423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras_big/d63457f03bb4b24dcd0197fbbd9ee6be.avif?t=1784152423 width=800 height=554 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/fff3881adaa3a86d01765228b67ba37b.avif?t=1784152423\" width=761 height=476 /></span><strong></strong><br> <strong>Robot Rhapsody is a 'new-retro' cinematic RPG set in a future world on the edges of machine singularity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❤️‍🔥 Challenging turn-based combat, inspired by classic RPGs.<br>⚙️ HACK robot enemies to join the party. UPGRADE them all with distinct items and parts.<br>💥 Story Themes touching AI, futurism, cultism, dystopias, and transcendence.<br><strong>🗺️ Open-ended exploration.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/fb0fdcf13b6a01c5885adaf1762df8e0.avif?t=1784152423\" width=761 height=476 /></span><br> <br><strong>💥 Follow Selva, a cynical luddite mercenary. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formerly trained to hunt “rogue” robots, she now lives off-grid in exile.  <br>Yet new events drag her back to the technocratic future she can’t escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚙️ Her ally is Jiro, a boy raised entirely within the <u>Aethar Hives</u></strong>; <br>Underground bomb shelters that have been transformed into AI-controlled “utopias.” </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jiro's every move is micromanaged by “godlike” AGI, robots, photo-real VR, and negative-emotion-suppressing systems</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Despite their opposite nature, the two are ultimately drawn together. <br>A reluctant friendship that sparks widespread rebellion.</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/bab18db91e33418364cb47f13d511f4c.avif?t=1784152423\" width=761 height=476 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💥 </strong>Explore a war-scorched former metropolis; <u>Zoxxo City</u>. </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various new neighborhoods, shortcuts, quests, &amp; secrets appear incrementally as the story unfolds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful street vendors, machine smugglers, stem-cell harvesters, cultish luddites, and a deranged robotic carnival troupe are among dozens of NPCs you'll encounter. Inspired by Majora's Mask, they each have their own evolving schedules.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/bf395802040eb1683109f2bae5ba9aec.avif?t=1784152423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras_big/bf395802040eb1683109f2bae5ba9aec.webp?t=1784152423 width=1560 height=1601 /></span><u>Navigate the BOUNTY system</u>: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players will be hunted by malevolent robots</strong>, <u>to a greater or lesser extent</u>, stemming from player choices!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain the chance to Inflict</strong> <strong>machine-specific status effects,</strong> such as <strong><u>SHORT-CIRCUIT</u> (electric stun)</strong>, and <strong><u>VIRUS</u> (confused/berserk behavior), </strong>to disadvantage the robot foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain characters can use <strong><u>HACK</u></strong>, forcing some robotic enemies to fight alongside the party—or even upgrade them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike human allies; once robot allies reach K/O status, they're gone forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d9ae6630b30c97f22ab1d819fcc733fd.poster.avif?t=1784152423\" width=594 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d9ae6630b30c97f22ab1d819fcc733fd.webm?t=1784152423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d9ae6630b30c97f22ab1d819fcc733fd.mp4?t=1784152423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/ff63b55b71b324baf043ecbe46340675.avif?t=1784152423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras_big/ff63b55b71b324baf043ecbe46340675.avif?t=1784152423 width=800 height=566 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unlike Beloved Rapture, our previous title</i> - <strong><u>in Robot Rhapsody, most of the game's world will be completely open from the very start of the game</u></strong>, encouraging greater replay value, and player-defined consequences. The sprawling world offers freedom for the player to chart their own path - yet the &quot;main story&quot; remains cinematic/linear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d63457f03bb4b24dcd0197fbbd9ee6be.avif?t=1784152423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras_big/d63457f03bb4b24dcd0197fbbd9ee6be.avif?t=1784152423 width=800 height=554 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A turn-based RPG following Selva, a retired mercenary; Aurum, a poetic &quot;robot bard&quot;; and allies including engineers, luddite artists, and survivors fighting back against AI-controlled &quot;utopias&quot;. Recruit machines to your side, upgrade with salvaged tech, &amp; explore bizarre pockets of human resistance.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/e899b